SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaIntro:
	.string "OH MY GOD! Finally, a new face!\n"
	.string "The kegs are tapped and the vibes\l"
	.string "are absolutely massive!\p"
	.string "I learned everything about 'fluid\n"
	.string "dynamics' from WALLACE, and by that\l"
	.string "I mean how to finish a pint in under\l"
	.string "three seconds!\p"
	.string "Battle first, then we're doing shots\n"
	.string "until we can't see the ceiling!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaDefeat:
	.string "Total buzzkill! You ruined my\n"
	.string "momentum! Sorry, WALLACE!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaPostBattle:
	.string "Watch your step on those tiles.\n"
	.string "If you crack them, you'll fall down\l"
	.string "to where the real alcoholics live.\p"
	.string "And honestly? Those guys don't even\n"
	.string "chant 'Chug! Chug! Chug!' before\l"
	.string "they drink. Total losers!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyIntro:
	.string "You came all the way here, but you won't\n"
	.string "get to see WALLACE.\p"
	.string "Not if you lose to me! I'm already\n"
	.string "six tequila shots deep and I'm still\l"
	.string "hitting every move! Bottoms up!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyDefeat:
	.string "Whoa! Everything is spinning!\n"
	.string "I think I saw double of your team!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyPostBattle:
	.string "You might be good enough to avoid\n"
	.string "being wiped out in one hit by WALLACE.\p"
	.string "The man drinks Potion-infused vodka\n"
	.string "for breakfast. You have no idea what\l"
	.string "kind of monster you're facing!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneIntro:
	.string "Ugh, another ruffian reeking of\n"
	.string "fermented hops and poor life choices.\p"
	.string "WALLACE possesses a certain flair,\n"
	.string "I admit, but this 'drinking fest'\l"
	.string "is utterly pedestrian.\p"
	.string "I shall maintain my composure with\n"
	.string "a delicate cup of Yorkshire Gold.\l"
	.string "Pinkies up, peasant! Let us see if\l"
	.string "your breeding matches your bravado.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneDefeat:
	.string "Good heavens! My finest porcelain\n"
	.string "integrity has been compromised!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphnePostBattle:
	.string "The vigor you display is almost as\n"
	.string "stimulating as a perfectly steeped\l"
	.string "pot of Earl Grey at high noon.\p"
	.string "Now, do run along. The stench of\n"
	.string "unrefined spirits is causing my\l"
	.string "POLTEAGEIST to lose its steep.\p"
	.string "Simply dreadful behavior, really.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieIntro:
	.string "I should teach you how harsh hangovers\n"
	.string "can be.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieDefeat:
	.string "Ooff.\n"
	.string "You're strong.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConniePostBattle:
	.string "I'll tell you something good.\p"
	.string "If you want to reach WALLACE, hic, you\n"
	.string "need to walk on each floor tile once.\p"
	.string "Which is quite difficult to be fair\n"
	.string "after a bottle or seven.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetIntro:
	.string "The Louis Jadot Chassagne-Montrachet\n"
	.string "1er Cru Morgeot Clos de la Chapelle\l"
	.string "Domaine du Duc de Magenta...\p"
	.string "That Bourgogne is of the highest\n"
	.string "level, just like the SOOTOPOLIS GYM!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetDefeat:
	.string "What a high level you are!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetPostBattle:
	.string "Rather than being satisfied by being\n"
	.string "in a strong GYM, I imagine training in\l"
	.string "other places will make you stronger.\p"
	.string "But above all, it looks more fun.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaIntro:
	.string "I train my POKéMON together with\n"
	.string "WALLACE while sipping mojitos.\p"
	.string "Don't think I'm a pushover just\n"
	.string "because I'm wearing these UFO\l"
	.string "lenses! This Aperol Spritz gives me\l"
	.string "all the tactical vision I need!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaDefeat:
	.string "I was beaten… and I spilled my\n"
	.string "drink. Not cute!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaPostBattle:
	.string "I think you have potential.\p"
	.string "Why don't you stay and train with us?\n"
	.string "We've got an open bar and the sun\l"
	.string "never sets when you're this buzzed!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyIntro:
	.string "A graceful glide across the ice while\n"
	.string "hand-carving a perfect sphere...\p"
	.string "A TRAINER putting on that performance\n"
	.string "with a crystal-clear block of ice\l"
	.string "would be elegantly beautiful!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyDefeat:
	.string "Well, excuse me?!\n"
	.string "You just shattered my ice sculpture!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyPostBattle:
	.string "This is really obvious, but how strong\n"
	.string "you are as a TRAINER has nothing to do\l"
	.string "with how young or old you are.\p"
	.string "It is all about the clarity of your\n"
	.string "ice and the sharpness of your knife!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyIntro:
	.string "When I'm with my POKéMON and a bottle\n"
	.string "of cheap tequila, the time flies by\l"
	.string "before you can say, “Oops!”$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyDefeat:
	.string "Oops!\n"
	.string "There goes my dignity!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyPostBattle:
	.string "I wish I could forget about my ex\n"
	.string "and all my other lost causes before\l"
	.string "I can manage an “Oops!”\p"
	.string "Does anyone have some water? Or a\n"
	.string "time machine? Anything?$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaIntro:
	.string "I can battle with really rare POKéMON\n"
	.string "and some top-shelf Shochu, if you'd\l"
	.string "like! 'Hic'\p"
	.string "You're a sharp-looking one, aren't\n"
	.string "you? Let's see if your POKéMON are\l"
	.string "as strong as this Highball!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, there now! Did you have a good\n"
	.string "look at my POKéMON, or was it the\l"
	.string "Sake talking?$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaPostBattle:
	.string "I came to this GYM because WALLACE\n"
	.string "praised me for my darling POKéMON\l"
	.string "and my ability to finish a bottle.\p"
	.string "Oh, if only I'd met a strong trainer\n"
	.string "like you years ago when I was\l"
	.string "younger... We could have painted the\l"
	.string "city red!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaIntro:
	.string "Giggle… Your grim look is so charming.\n"
	.string "Is it because you're waiting for your\l"
	.string "Long Island Iced Tea?\p"
	.string "Wait… was it gin and vodka? Or rum\n"
	.string "and… peppermint? My phone screen is\l"
	.string "so blurry, I can't read the recipe!$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaDefeat:
	.string "Oh, dear. I went much too easy on\n"
	.string "you because I was distracted by\l"
	.string "this Wikipedia page on 'Triple Sec'.$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaPostBattle:
	.string "You couldn't lay a finger on WALLACE,\n"
	.string "I'm sure. Giggle…\p"
	.string "Mainly because he actually knows\n"
	.string "the difference between Tequila and\l"
	.string "dish soap. I'll get this drink right\l"
	.string "eventually!$"

